WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:36.760 --> 01:37.300
Shit!

01:53.040 --> 01:54.210
Wait!

02:06.120 --> 02:07.370
It broke!

02:07.370 --> 02:08.890
Noooo!

02:08.920 --> 02:11.710
Why don't you buy a new one?

02:11.750 --> 02:12.990
Don't say it so easily!

02:13.490 --> 02:16.400
Punk Street is straight ahead.

02:16.590 --> 02:19.400
I heard that there is a
legendary blacksmith there.

02:19.430 --> 02:20.890
I think his name was Musica.

02:21.100 --> 02:22.400
Musica?

02:22.490 --> 02:28.190
The legendary blacksmith Musica

02:35.020 --> 02:36.820
Hmph, they finally noticed.

02:38.550 --> 02:42.320
He's got a lot of nerves, stealing
money from the Demon Card!

02:48.650 --> 02:49.730
That was some good work.

02:49.760 --> 02:52.900
It went really well, didn't it, Musica?

02:52.940 --> 02:53.430
Yeah.

02:59.680 --> 03:04.210
Come on, Elie, are we at Punk Street yet?

03:04.450 --> 03:04.950
Hmm...

03:05.740 --> 03:07.020
We're almost there.

03:08.350 --> 03:11.620
You have been saying
almost for three days now.

03:11.650 --> 03:13.040
If you think about it, you won't make it.

03:13.060 --> 03:15.000
No! I think a lot.

03:16.560 --> 03:22.600
Alright! When I get to Punk Street, I'm
going to upgrade my Tonfa Guns!

03:24.310 --> 03:25.900
She's not listening to me.

03:32.710 --> 03:35.210
My watering can.

03:42.130 --> 03:43.050
Plue!

03:43.840 --> 03:46.220
Rain? But there are no clouds.

03:49.120 --> 03:50.060
What the...

03:50.060 --> 03:51.090
What?!

03:53.580 --> 03:57.600
Hey, are you the one that shot at us?

03:59.000 --> 04:00.600
Who are you?

04:00.730 --> 04:04.300
Be surprised! Even crying children will shut up
because we are The Silver Rhythm Bandits!

04:04.390 --> 04:05.210
Bandits?

04:06.070 --> 04:10.610
Because of you, my
precious can has hole in it.

04:10.650 --> 04:11.940
What are you going to do about it?!

04:12.010 --> 04:13.920
I see, I got it!

04:14.040 --> 04:17.820
The rain earlier was leaking from this.

04:17.900 --> 04:18.300
Huh?

04:18.520 --> 04:22.220
I'm not talking about that! Pay for it, pay for it!

04:22.880 --> 04:24.040
That sword...

04:24.050 --> 04:26.900
I'll forgive you for this, but it's broken.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.710
Gimme it back, this is a very precious sword.

04:30.100 --> 04:32.920
My watering can was also very precious.

04:32.960 --> 04:35.260
Do you want to fight with us?

04:35.310 --> 04:36.710
Why you...

04:38.920 --> 04:40.200
Wait!

04:46.060 --> 04:48.030
Are you the bandit's leader?

04:48.070 --> 04:48.920
Sort of.

04:49.850 --> 04:53.150
My sister told me, bandits are bad guys.

04:53.230 --> 04:55.120
So what?

04:55.340 --> 04:57.290
You going beat us?

05:01.360 --> 05:03.000
Hebi, let's go.

05:03.400 --> 05:06.630
But! What about my watering can?

05:06.730 --> 05:08.200
Let me look at it.

05:17.990 --> 05:20.420
Here. It's fine now, right?

05:20.530 --> 05:22.520
Wow, he's very good indeed.

05:22.620 --> 05:23.420
Let's go.

05:34.830 --> 05:36.820
Who were those guys?

05:41.970 --> 05:46.710
Lance, last night, the casino
was robbed by Silver Rhythm again.

05:46.860 --> 05:48.110
Lance!

05:48.360 --> 05:50.910
Shut up! Who cares about the
small change from a casino.

05:50.920 --> 05:52.510
Those sneaky thieves can have it.

05:52.550 --> 05:53.700
But...

05:54.640 --> 05:57.320
I'm only interested in Rave right now.

05:57.850 --> 05:59.240
Beast.

06:02.490 --> 06:05.190
Have the Rave Master appeared yet?

06:05.520 --> 06:06.900
Not yet.

06:08.240 --> 06:11.100
You know what to do
when he shows up, right?

06:12.160 --> 06:13.400
Of course.

06:13.590 --> 06:17.170
The Rave Master even Shuda couldn't defeat...

06:17.180 --> 06:20.000
And to think that I'm about to defeat him...

06:20.010 --> 06:21.450
I'm so excited!

06:22.320 --> 06:24.810
Hmmm... So that's what happened.

06:24.880 --> 06:29.680
So be careful when you shoot with Tonfa Guns.

06:29.800 --> 06:31.460
Yes, Boss.

06:31.460 --> 06:32.610
Boss?!

06:34.950 --> 06:36.760
Look! Over there!

06:41.630 --> 06:45.930
WOW! So this is Punk Street.

06:47.230 --> 06:51.370
What? Everyone is carrying a weapon.

06:51.430 --> 06:52.540
Of course.

06:52.600 --> 06:55.940
In Kodu land, which is further north,
it's even more dangerous.

06:56.350 --> 06:58.180
Then, first of all, Musica...

06:58.240 --> 07:00.250
First, let's go gamble!

07:01.100 --> 07:04.850
Boss, Elie is going to get
some money for our weapons!

07:04.910 --> 07:06.860
Ca-casino.

07:07.060 --> 07:09.260
She is a weird girl, after all.

07:12.090 --> 07:14.430
Sake! Bring sake!

07:14.550 --> 07:16.150
There isn't any sake for you!

07:16.450 --> 07:17.520
Now hurry up and go home!

07:18.490 --> 07:21.450
Why is that? Why is there no sake here?

07:21.950 --> 07:24.090
It's because you drunk it all!

07:24.460 --> 07:25.960
Shoo, shoo, go home, go home!

07:31.100 --> 07:34.700
My sister told me not to
associate with drunkards.

07:35.290 --> 07:37.790
Let's go, Plue. Let's get some lunch.

07:37.790 --> 07:39.150
Huh? Plue?

07:40.610 --> 07:43.210
You're a strong drinker, kid!

07:43.240 --> 07:45.540
I beg of you, please, go home!

07:50.350 --> 07:51.950
You're pretty good.

07:54.850 --> 07:57.420
Why are you drinking sake in the afternoon?

07:57.850 --> 08:00.190
Kid, are you his friend?

08:00.340 --> 08:01.360
That's right.

08:01.700 --> 08:02.980
Plue, let's go.

08:03.230 --> 08:04.930
What an unfriendly guy.

08:05.460 --> 08:07.000
Why don't you sit down there?

08:07.570 --> 08:10.140
I'm sorry, but we have some
business to take care of.

08:11.670 --> 08:16.910
When do you have to take
care of your business?

08:19.280 --> 08:23.080
Let it go! I have to look
for a blacksmith named Musica.

08:23.780 --> 08:24.580
Musica...

08:33.490 --> 08:35.990
I'll find him, just leave it to me...

08:35.600 --> 08:36.170
What?!

08:36.180 --> 08:38.360
Old man, you know where Musica lives?

08:41.470 --> 08:46.070
I want to go home.

08:46.540 --> 08:47.950
Damn...

08:48.380 --> 08:50.740
This is the only way.

08:50.740 --> 08:53.250
Hey, you guys, pay up!

08:56.210 --> 08:57.160
What's your name?

08:57.160 --> 08:58.130
I'm Haru.

08:58.340 --> 08:59.450
This is Plue.

09:00.010 --> 09:01.560
Hmm... Ham and Pudding?

09:01.570 --> 09:02.590
Haru and Plue!

09:03.450 --> 09:07.570
Kid, can't you walk faster?
You are young, but....

09:08.320 --> 09:09.590
Damn.

09:09.990 --> 09:13.100
Wahaha. That's great, kid!
You are like a turbo engine.

09:14.360 --> 09:16.420
I'm very lucky, after all!

09:16.420 --> 09:19.120
With this, the Tonfa Gun's upgrade
will be completed perfectly!

09:19.490 --> 09:21.360
Ok, I'm going do a lot of gambling.

09:21.360 --> 09:23.870
Well, we do have a lot of money.

09:44.080 --> 09:45.960
Good! Kid, drink more!

09:48.790 --> 09:52.300
Hey, tell me where Musica's place is already.

10:05.100 --> 10:06.230
Plue?!

10:06.500 --> 10:10.290
Plue, you too! Drinking so much...

10:20.970 --> 10:22.330
Oh, here it comes!

10:25.760 --> 10:28.640
It's a big one!

10:33.410 --> 10:34.750
What is this guy?

10:38.650 --> 10:39.650
Sister!

10:40.620 --> 10:43.760
Haru, don't be so noisy in
front of mother's grave.

10:44.260 --> 10:46.330
I found an amazing fish!

10:46.390 --> 10:47.390
Fish?

10:47.390 --> 10:48.240
Here.

10:48.470 --> 10:50.400
Haha... It's cute!

10:52.420 --> 10:55.330
Haru, this is not a fish.

10:56.570 --> 10:57.300
It's a dog.

10:57.340 --> 10:58.600
That's definitely a lie!

11:01.240 --> 11:01.940
Plue?

11:02.130 --> 11:05.180
Oh, you're already sobering up, huh?

11:07.430 --> 11:10.680
Old man, when are you going
show me Musica's place?

11:11.260 --> 11:12.380
Old man!

11:12.790 --> 11:13.990
Don't fall asleep!!

11:16.050 --> 11:19.090
Plue! You are drinking too much!

11:23.160 --> 11:24.700
Good job, little kid!

11:25.460 --> 11:27.370
Sober up already, you guys!

11:28.610 --> 11:31.570
It's cold! What the hell
are you doing, kid!?

11:32.300 --> 11:35.210
So.. Tell me where Musica is.

11:35.560 --> 11:38.280
I want him to fix my sword
as soon as possible.

11:40.310 --> 11:41.670
Noisy kid.

11:41.840 --> 11:44.050
Because of you, I'm sobered up now.

11:47.250 --> 11:49.230
Musica is...

11:49.500 --> 11:50.590
me.

11:53.360 --> 11:54.360
You are...

11:54.510 --> 11:55.460
Musica?!

12:07.340 --> 12:10.780
That's right. The blacksmith Musica is me.

12:11.240 --> 12:15.010
You are Musica... the legendary blacksmith.

12:17.650 --> 12:19.480
This sword was given to me by Shiba.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.450
Shiba?

12:20.950 --> 12:22.420
The sword warrior, Shiba?

12:22.700 --> 12:25.690
I haven't seen him for decades.

12:26.160 --> 12:27.290
This is a very precious sword.

12:27.860 --> 12:29.460
I heard that you can fix it.

12:39.990 --> 12:41.980
Ten Commandments...

12:43.100 --> 12:46.630
What about Rave? Rave must have been
attached to this sword.

12:48.460 --> 12:51.310
If you don't have Rave,
then I can't fix this sword.

12:54.450 --> 12:55.320
I have it here.

12:59.360 --> 13:01.130
Then, you can fix it right?

13:07.870 --> 13:08.990
It will take two days.

13:09.480 --> 13:12.450
Never come by this house for those 2 days.

13:16.490 --> 13:18.310
Are you done upgrading my Tonfa Guns?

13:18.710 --> 13:19.560
Yeah.

13:23.650 --> 13:25.650
Thank you. Here's what I owe you.

13:26.350 --> 13:27.390
Thank you.

13:30.660 --> 13:32.820
Let's see, Haru and Plue are...

13:33.530 --> 13:35.190
It was bad luck.

13:36.640 --> 13:40.770
There is no point in losing the money we
robbed from one casino, gambling at another one.

13:41.470 --> 13:45.670
I see! We should rob it again tonight
and get our money back.

13:45.770 --> 13:49.450
N-no... That's not what I meant, Musica.

13:50.750 --> 13:51.820
Musica?

13:55.420 --> 13:56.200
It's me.

13:57.550 --> 13:58.880
Send me Beast.

14:00.950 --> 14:02.020
Wait... Wait a minute.

14:03.060 --> 14:05.230
Excuse me, are you Musica?

14:05.660 --> 14:08.070
Hey you, what do you want with Musica?

14:08.560 --> 14:12.340
More importantly, how do you
know Musica's name?

14:12.660 --> 14:13.530
Stop it, now.

14:14.270 --> 14:16.770
It seems like she is hitting on me.

14:17.340 --> 14:18.700
No... I don't think so!

14:19.540 --> 14:22.010
I was right! You are Musica, right?

14:22.640 --> 14:27.110
Umm... Yeah, but what does a
cute girl like you want with me?

14:28.250 --> 14:30.750
I have a favor to ask you,
so can you follow me?

14:31.450 --> 14:32.790
Ah! I'm so lucky!

14:32.790 --> 14:36.790
I lost all my money at the casino,
but a cute girl like her is hitting on me!

14:36.790 --> 14:39.060
My luck with the ladies must be getting better.

14:40.460 --> 14:42.330
Hey... Can you?

14:42.460 --> 14:43.690
Of course, I can.

14:43.880 --> 14:44.760
Cool!

14:45.250 --> 14:48.770
Hey, you guys. Go kill your time
at an arcade until nighttime.

14:50.020 --> 14:52.340
No, wait. Till morning!

14:52.340 --> 14:55.240
That's unfair! Only Musica
gets to be with the girl.

14:55.590 --> 14:57.570
Shut up! Get out of here!

15:01.650 --> 15:02.810
You got it?

15:03.350 --> 15:04.310
It's on the desk.

15:04.350 --> 15:07.550
Good job, old man. This will make Lance very happy.

15:08.050 --> 15:10.440
Leave if you're done.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.780
The sake isn't good now.

15:13.660 --> 15:15.120
Hey, wait a minute.

15:15.610 --> 15:18.290
Rave's not on it. Why is it not there?

15:18.760 --> 15:20.100
I don't know.

15:20.590 --> 15:25.640
I did just as I was told, I
took the sword from him.

15:25.720 --> 15:30.130
You are just a blacksmith.
Don't speak to me like that.

15:32.840 --> 15:35.650
This means that the kid still has Rave.

15:36.250 --> 15:37.590
You useless old man!

15:37.590 --> 15:40.370
You should not anger Lance.

15:41.250 --> 15:43.360
Otherwise you won't be drinking
anymore of your favorite sake.

15:51.560 --> 15:52.600
Let's see...

15:52.700 --> 15:55.200
Around here... Isn't this good enough already?

15:58.160 --> 16:00.300
Haru! Here, here!

16:00.370 --> 16:02.640
I don't like you playing hard to get.

16:03.940 --> 16:07.400
Where were you? I've been looking for you!

16:05.640 --> 16:07.150
Hmph, she's with a guy.

16:09.550 --> 16:10.350
That guy...

16:11.150 --> 16:12.920
Plue, are you drunk?

16:12.950 --> 16:15.510
Yeah, we met a really drunk old man.

16:15.850 --> 16:16.350
Hey!

16:17.900 --> 16:18.660
You!

16:19.160 --> 16:21.710
Heh, I didn't think we would meet this soon.

16:21.860 --> 16:25.900
What the heck, I thought I've met Musica first.

16:25.950 --> 16:27.800
Musica?! That guy is?!

16:27.950 --> 16:29.290
That's right.

16:29.470 --> 16:30.760
That must be a lie.

16:30.860 --> 16:33.740
It's not a lie. What are you guys?!

16:33.840 --> 16:36.440
Because I already met Musica.

16:36.510 --> 16:39.130
Eh? Then, who is this guy?

16:39.240 --> 16:41.250
My name is Musica.

16:41.750 --> 16:44.450
Silver Rhythm, Bandit Musica.

16:45.150 --> 16:46.750
Didn't you know that?

16:47.350 --> 16:48.530
Sorry, I didn't.

16:48.530 --> 16:49.530
What?!

16:49.660 --> 16:51.790
Bandit? It is not him then.

16:51.860 --> 16:54.910
The Musica we're looking for is a blacksmith.

16:55.250 --> 16:57.230
Blacksmith Musica.

16:59.570 --> 17:00.870
Never heard of him.

17:02.420 --> 17:06.130
Did you also leave your
precious sword with him?

17:06.300 --> 17:07.570
Umm... Yeah.

17:07.700 --> 17:10.470
Fool! He completely deceived you!

17:10.470 --> 17:11.140
What?

17:11.140 --> 17:12.200
In this kind or town

17:12.350 --> 17:15.750
he must be a person working
for the Demon Card or something.

17:15.750 --> 17:17.900
Well, you should be more careful next time.

17:19.750 --> 17:20.860
That's the guy?

17:21.150 --> 17:22.540
Yes, most likely.

17:22.750 --> 17:25.990
What the... He's really just a kid.

17:34.270 --> 17:36.540
Screw type Shotgun!

17:49.230 --> 17:50.610
Demon Card?

17:52.150 --> 17:55.760
As soon as we mentioned the Demon
Card, the lower ranks show up.

17:57.860 --> 17:59.720
You better watch your mouth, kid!

17:59.760 --> 18:03.860
Who are you calling lower ranks? Who?!

18:03.900 --> 18:05.750
You don't even know yourself?

18:05.830 --> 18:08.200
I can see it in your face.

18:10.340 --> 18:11.630
Search them for Rave.

18:11.630 --> 18:12.480
Yes.

18:13.540 --> 18:14.840
R-Rave?!

18:15.340 --> 18:16.640
Wha... What are you doing?!

18:19.040 --> 18:21.120
Hey! Where are you touching?

18:22.550 --> 18:23.650
That tickles!

18:24.350 --> 18:26.640
If these guys are after Rave,

18:26.720 --> 18:29.560
then the sword he was just
talking about must be...

18:29.660 --> 18:30.940
Damn!

18:31.000 --> 18:33.960
I could take these off if I had my Rave.

18:34.960 --> 18:37.160
Beast, it's not here.

18:37.310 --> 18:38.240
What?!

18:38.260 --> 18:40.250
Hey, kid! Where's the Rave?

18:40.570 --> 18:42.550
I'm... not... telling... you!

18:42.780 --> 18:45.930
That means... the old man

18:46.000 --> 18:47.490
had it after all.

18:48.120 --> 18:51.520
I'll leave this to you guys.
Finish these kids.

18:54.360 --> 18:57.430
Finish the girl? How should we do it?

18:57.620 --> 19:00.050
Heh, should we hit it quick in private?

19:02.550 --> 19:06.060
It stings! Stings! Something stung me.

19:13.870 --> 19:16.380
Wow, that cat is cool! Is it a chihuahua?

19:16.430 --> 19:17.470
You think it's a cat?

19:17.600 --> 19:19.020
But chihuahua is a dog!

19:29.350 --> 19:30.880
Who are you?

19:31.160 --> 19:32.060
Ah! That guy is!

19:33.290 --> 19:35.020
Three piercing in a row on his forehead.

19:35.160 --> 19:36.460
A silver skull...

19:37.060 --> 19:39.270
A bandit, Silver Rhythm's Musica!

19:39.960 --> 19:44.720
That guy, they say he's been
robbing a lot around here lately.

19:45.320 --> 19:48.370
I see. Even the lower ranks know a little.

19:48.770 --> 19:51.560
Then, this is a good chance
to finish them together!

19:52.240 --> 19:54.930
You guys are the ones who
are going to be finished!

19:59.550 --> 20:01.510
Ok, I'm going go for it too!

20:01.750 --> 20:05.230
Get out of my way! Let me try
the power of my new Tonfa Guns!

20:05.550 --> 20:08.150
You guys are going pay
for touching my things.

20:13.560 --> 20:15.060
These are single-barreled guns.

20:15.660 --> 20:17.710
You made a mistake, old man!

20:17.800 --> 20:19.710
These are dangerous, right?

20:20.430 --> 20:22.470
But their destructive power was great.

20:22.830 --> 20:26.170
Hey, were you going to kill me too?!

20:30.640 --> 20:31.950
Don't back off. Get them!

20:32.700 --> 20:34.280
Hey you, what's your name?

20:35.050 --> 20:35.620
Haru.

20:35.660 --> 20:36.870
Haru Glory.

20:36.960 --> 20:39.340
I'm starting to like you.
Want to join my team?

20:39.640 --> 20:41.240
Be a bandit?! No, thanks.

20:41.350 --> 20:44.390
By the way, I haven't met a
strong fighter like you in a while.

20:44.460 --> 20:45.820
Shouldn't we fight some time?

20:45.860 --> 20:48.090
Don't even try. You can't beat me.

20:50.610 --> 20:51.660
Thank you, Plue.

20:57.230 --> 21:00.320
Old man Musica, you are going to pay for this!

21:12.750 --> 21:14.750
Hey, Haru, are you a Rave Master?

21:15.150 --> 21:16.420
Yeah, sort of.

21:16.820 --> 21:19.290
How come a Rave Master
doesn't have any Rave?

21:19.720 --> 21:22.930
I left it with Musica the Blacksmith,
the one I talked about earlier.

21:23.170 --> 21:25.800
If so, the Rave will not be returned to you.

21:27.930 --> 21:29.640
That Musica is a fake.

21:32.800 --> 21:36.640
The Musica family... was destroyed.

21:37.010 --> 21:38.710
I'm the only one left.

21:40.450 --> 21:43.520
Therefore, only I have the name Musica.

21:44.550 --> 21:46.720
Th-hen, that old man was...

21:57.620 --> 21:58.960
Rave...

21:59.570 --> 22:01.730
Stupid kid.

22:03.260 --> 22:06.540
Bringing such a thing to me at this time.

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:41.430 --> 23:44.640
Blacksmith Musica and
Silver Rhythm Musica?!

23:45.070 --> 23:46.990
Which on earth is which?!

23:47.350 --> 23:49.200
I believe in the old man.

23:49.540 --> 23:51.290
Hey, old man!

23:51.290 --> 23:55.800
Quit drinking already.
Harry up and fix my Ten Commandments.

23:55.980 --> 23:58.880
Help me, Haru! I got caught by Demon Card!

23:59.250 --> 24:00.790
On the next episode of Rave!

24:00.790 --> 24:02.750
Brutal swordsman Lance.

24:02.790 --> 24:04.510
Just wait, Elie!
